# W31c2, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land, b joins in stag0201; a goes into dng204b1 alone (matz01) and, 45 s after it had
# control there, back to stag0201 (depart: alone in its stage group, the way matz01 of dng204b1 takes) while b's GO
# barrier is held by the relay's test hook (World:TestGoBarrierHoldMs 40 s).
# (It heals from the L panel at 350 HP on the way to matz01: stag0201's mummies felled W31b's b in run d1.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=2,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@400 fail stagechange
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@700
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@700
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@700
log a in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=600
idle until frames>=2100 fail present>=2
depart stag0201 1 until stage=stag0201,control fail epoch>=@900
log a back in stag0201
idle until frames>=3600 fail stagechange
log a done
